      <title>Московская встреча пользователей Си&#43;&#43; - часть 2</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F-%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%B0-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B9-%D1%81%D0%B8-%D1%87%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C-2/</link>
